OL,3,ABurnham to set out options next month
OL,4,Afor long-term EU relationship
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham will travel to the meeting with
OL,7,Fthe EU this Friday, where both sides
OL,8,Fhope to unveil new agreements on food,
OL,9,Fyouth visas and re-linking British
OL,10,Findustry to the EU's carbon trading
OL,11,Fregime.
OL,13,FHowever, it is understood he will not
OL,14,Findicate any preference at this stage
OL,15,Fwhich of the long-term options he could
OL,16,Fback in future.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
